{{!
    @template local_moodesk/kb_suggestions

    The "Suggested articles" block of the New Ticket form (KB-04).

    Rendered once by new_ticket_drawer and placed by submit_ticket_form as an
    html element between the category / department row and the description,
    so the drawer and submit.php get it in the same place. Server-side it is
    the heading, an empty body and a live region; local_moodesk/kb_suggestions
    fills the body as the subject is typed, from local_moodesk_search_kb_articles.

    Everything the module needs to know is on the root element: the ids of the
    fields it listens to, the minimum length, the debounce, and the sentences
    it puts in the live region. Nothing here decides what is shown — the
    endpoint and the service do.

    Context variables:
      * rootid        - Id of the block; the heading is "{rootid}-title" and the
                        hint for the subject field "{rootid}-hint"
      * subjectid     - Id of the subject input to listen to
      * categoryname  - Name of the category field in the same form as the
                        subject (a select, or a hidden input when the site has
                        a single category — which carries no id)
      * minlength     - Shortest subject that triggers a request
      * debounce      - Milliseconds of quiet before a request
      * heading       - "Suggested articles"
      * intro         - Short sentence under the heading, shown with results
      * subjecthint   - Visually hidden sentence the module attaches to the
                        subject field with aria-describedby
      * updating      - Status text while a newer request is in flight
      * strloading    - Live-region sentence while loading (past the delay)
      * strnone       - Live-region sentence when nothing matched
      * strerror      - Text shown when the request failed
      * strresults    - Live-region sentence for N results ("{$a}" placeholder)
      * strresultsone - Live-region sentence for one result

    Example context (json):
    {
      "rootid": "mhd-kb-suggest-64f1",
      "subjectid": "id_subject",
      "categoryname": "categoryid",
      "minlength": 3,
      "debounce": 300,
      "heading": "Suggested articles",
      "intro": "These articles may already answer your question.",
      "subjecthint": "Suggested articles appear below the category as you type.",
      "updating": "Updating…",
      "strloading": "Searching the knowledge base…",
      "strnone": "No matching articles.",
      "strerror": "Suggestions are unavailable right now.",
      "strresults": "{$a} suggested articles",
      "strresultsone": "1 suggested article"
    }
}}
<section class="mhd-kb-suggest is-idle"
         id="{{rootid}}"
         data-region="mhd-kb-suggest"
         data-subject-id="{{subjectid}}"
         data-category-name="{{categoryname}}"
         data-min-length="{{minlength}}"
         data-debounce="{{debounce}}"
         data-str-loading="{{strloading}}"
         data-str-none="{{strnone}}"
         data-str-error="{{strerror}}"
         data-str-results="{{strresults}}"
         data-str-results-one="{{strresultsone}}"
         aria-labelledby="{{rootid}}-title">
    <div class="mhd-kb-suggest__head">
        <h3 class="mhd-kb-suggest__title" id="{{rootid}}-title">{{heading}}</h3>
        <span class="mhd-kb-suggest__status" data-region="mhd-kb-suggest-status" aria-hidden="true">{{updating}}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mhd-kb-suggest__intro">{{intro}}</p>
    <p class="sr-only" id="{{rootid}}-hint">{{subjecthint}}</p>
    <div class="mhd-kb-suggest__body" data-region="mhd-kb-suggest-body"></div>
    <p class="mhd-kb-suggest__error" data-region="mhd-kb-suggest-error">{{strerror}}</p>
    <div class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-region="mhd-kb-suggest-live"></div>
</section>
